    <icon type="stock">app.hearth.Hearth</icon>
    <description>
        <p>Hearth is a free and open-source instant messaging and voice-over-IP application. It provides text chat, voice calls, video calls, and screen sharing in a modern interface.</p>
        <p>Features include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Text messaging with rich formatting and media support</li>
            <li>Voice and video calls</li>
            <li>Screen sharing</li>
            <li>Communities with channels</li>
            <li>Direct messages and group chats</li>
            <li>Custom emoji and reactions</li>
        </ul>
    </description>
